category: Libs
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Embeddable Datastore Engine (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "Vedis is an embeddable datastore C library built with over 70 commands similar
in concept to Redis but without the networking layer since Vedis run in the
same process of the host application."
